      "id": "la-ch09-item-2-3-5",
      "sourceStart": 9775,
      "sourceEnd": 9952,
      "original": "#### 2.3.5. Suppose $F=\\mathbb{C}$. Let $\\lambda_1,\\ldots,\\lambda_m$ be distinct eigenvalues of $T \\in \\mathcal{L}(V)$ and let $d_1,\\ldots,d_m$ denote their multiplicities. Then",
      "action": "moved-to-item-title-and-statement"
    },
