    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "la-ch09-item-2-3-7",
      "sourceStart": 10172,
      "sourceEnd": 10257,
      "original": "#### 2.3.7. The characteristic polynomial of $T \\in \\mathcal{L}(V)$ can be written as",
      "action": "moved-to-item-title-and-statement"
