    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "la-ch09-item-2-3-8",
      "sourceStart": 10329,
      "sourceEnd": 10432,
      "original": "#### 2.3.8. <span style=\"color: red\">(Hadamard’s inequality)</span> Suppose $A\\in F^{n \\times n}$. Then",
      "action": "moved-to-item-title-and-statement"
    },
    {
