      "id": "la-ch09-item-2-4-1",
      "sourceStart": 10884,
      "sourceEnd": 10967,
      "original": "#### 2.4.1. $(v_1,\\ldots,v_m)\\mapsto v_1 \\otimes \\cdots \\otimes v_m$ is $m$-linear.",
      "action": "moved-to-item-title-and-statement"
    },
    {
