      "sourceStart": 10967,
      "sourceEnd": 10969,
      "sha256": "75a11da44c802486bc6f65640aa48a730f0f684c5c07a42ba3cd1735eb3fb070"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "la-ch09-item-2-4-2",
      "sourceStart": 10969,
      "sourceEnd": 11103,
      "original": "#### 2.4.2. Suppose $\\beta_i =\\{e_{i,1},\\ldots,e_{i,n_i}\\}$ is a linearly independent list in $V_i$ for each $i$, $i=1,\\ldots,m$. Then",
      "action": "moved-to-item-title-and-statement"
    },
    {
